cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "BRGC: Bounded Role-Aware Graph Context for relation prediction"
abstract: >-
  Code and training-free analysis scripts for the study "How Much Graph Context
  Does Relation Prediction Need? A Controlled Study of Endpoint Statistics and
  Bounded Local Context". Includes the frozen model implementation used for every
  reported run and the parameter-free endpoint baselines, entropy diagnostics, and
  bootstrap confidence-interval scripts.
